**Avoid self-review.** You own the proof writing;
do not use `reviewer` agents: Another agent owns
the grading pipeline.

**Be resourceful.** Use `leandoc` to inspect Lean APIs
and the available literature and reference tools to
check mathematical context. Use `tool_think` in both
